{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_07",
  "title": "疯狂的信号",
  "storyCode": "DV-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7e4de7dc8c2929927dd3c07ef0eebaf37bd7007064cb8bb3e2d9ae0a440b68eb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，这不是缪尔赛思主任吗？这么晚了您还来公司啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......咳咳，是啊，有工作没干完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您可真是辛苦啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这两位是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们的重要合作伙伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你没认出这位吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......我看不清脸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位可是源石理论学者、矿石病专家、天灾研究者，大名鼎鼎的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来是您啊！真是难得的机会，竟然让我碰到了像您这么厉害的科学家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（他根本没听说过我吧？）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（这都能糊弄过去？）",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们有急事需要尽快上楼——有机会的话，下回一起开午餐会啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。那就不耽误您的时间了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下，我刚才就觉得您很眼熟，您难道不是那位防......防......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......防护材料领域非常有名的专家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕尔维斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这几年莱茵的扩张速度很快，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新来的小朋友们还需要多长长见识啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵实验员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......两位主任同时出现？我、我......我还有工作没做完！我先走啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你不准备告诉他们我回来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请原谅我的老花眼，我以前认识您吗，美丽的瓦伊凡女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么事情的话，我就先回去了。太晚休息可不利于我这把年纪的人的身体健康。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尔维斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，缪尔赛思主任，别忘了你答应我的黑豆茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......他真的是路过吗，塞雷娅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在是凌晨四点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕尔维斯平常的下班时间是九个小时以前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然......直到最后一刻到来前，他都不会轻易把赌注压在斐尔迪南和克丽斯腾之间的任意一方身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他还想看看谁的赢面大呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算莱茵生命变成了废墟，他也一定是能活下来的那个吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们进了莱茵总部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领航小队，准备拦截。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别着急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我见过你和塞雷娅交手，对你的装备很感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "方便借我看一眼吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在战斗之前，你们是这么打招呼的吗，罗德岛的精英干员？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不要误解，刚才那句话，我不是以罗德岛精英干员的身份说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为一名机械师，我尊重任何优秀的技术及技术的发明者——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，在我夺下你那根形制特别的法杖之前，我想先询问一下你的意愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你很有趣，Mechanist先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前只是想去见一见塞雷娅，但你和你的上司......那位博士给了我更大的惊喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我的名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也调查过我，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掌握尽量多的信息，是我们这类人在动手之前的习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......莱茵总部的资料库里有你的名字，霍尔海雅女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不相信斐尔迪南会雇佣一名历史学家来追杀自己的同僚。就算是在充满不可能的哥伦比亚学界，这也太荒诞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那只是我的副业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的副业是研究历史？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是一名历史学者，我在这里，只是为了见证一则流传千年的预言成真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同样的，我也相信，未来的走向能揭示一些被掩埋的历史——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和你们一样，都是真相的追寻者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道怎么去找你的混蛋上司吗，研究员小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他应该在监控室里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拐角的地方有个通风口，要是能爬上去的话，就能用最快的速度抵达监控室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "动作要快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟，很快就有很多人来迎接我们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......警长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道你会站到对面去。你的意志还是不够坚定，你忘不了你和这名罪犯的过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他还不是罪犯，小子，能定罪的人从来不是你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在走一条不归路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？你们明明都那么优秀，为什么要自毁前程？为什么......她也不听我的劝阻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真正想提问的对象并不是我，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我也可以替她再教你一回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我们知道自己战斗是为了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了守护某些人......守护某些准则不被像那个混蛋主任那样的人践踏，我们从来不会犹豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不会像你一样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "落脚之前总是先看好阵营——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "动手之前还要问为什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们找到方向了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那快走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有弩，你没有。所以先别管我了，管好你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么不跟上去？你一路走到这里，不也是为了找那家伙算账吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我也有武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们很久没有并肩作战了，玛丽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么并肩作战......那时候只是玩游戏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛丽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说了，哪一次游戏不是我带你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的很想念......很想念那段时光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
