    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道啊，可我们不是在赶时间吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直接走的话肯定更快，要应对的武装人员也能更少些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，别走到前面那个位置——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我忘了，那里是监控区......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我们要转备用计划了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发现入侵者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里，在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住这几个入侵——等等，主任？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，雷吉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您怎么回来了......不，您已经没有权限，不能再往前走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "面对入侵者，展露出内心的犹豫只会给敌人机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要我再教你一遍该怎么做吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......举盾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眩晕器准备，瞄准入侵者——塞雷娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勉强算你合格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g11_monitoringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最新一批数据都记录好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
