      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意无人机的方位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要让实验体的行动影响到第一手数据的采集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，老板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要的第一手数据已经自己走到你面前来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很高兴......你没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在你手下工作了那么多年，阅读你的微表情也变成了工作的一部分——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的左侧眉毛轻微地上挑了一下。你明明很惊讶，老板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你总是能给我很多惊喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回来了，我终于可以好好松口气——那些蠢笨的新人需要像你这么优秀的研究员好好调教。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想让我当组长？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是组长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到桌上那把钥匙了吗？收下它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已经完全证明了自己的能力。你不再需要给任何人——无论是我还是多萝西——当助手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下一个项目，你会是第一负责人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这把钥匙就是我为你准备好的礼物。那是一间崭新的......空间充裕的实验室，属于你的实验室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论你想做什么研究，我和莱茵生命都会全力支持你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是还考虑过让我接任能量科主任？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不是没有这种可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你看起来并不惊喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为无论你给我的未来规划了什么道路......我的答案都是“不”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......放下你的法杖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在害怕什么？你怕我背叛你，在这个你即将迎来重大成功的关键时刻，让你没法看到自己的光辉未来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许我真的会考虑这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白。我明明给了你那么多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在你身上看到了天赋、勤勉和野心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些都是取得成功的必要品质，也正是这些品质铸就了我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当然不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是你真如你所言的那样器重我的话——你就应该把整个实验的真相都告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我，你会无视那些受试者的安危，你会把我当成监视多萝西的工具，等没用的时候，就让我连同你罪恶的证据一起灰飞烟灭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在你眼中，我是不是一个特别听话的傻子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奥利维亚明明提醒过我，我却直到你动手的最后一刻才醒悟过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还没有准备好，埃琳娜，我怕你会动摇，就跟现在这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你从来没有信任过我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不相信任何人。斐尔迪南，你只信你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，我凭什么要再信任你......相信你的这些许诺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从来没有给过任何人那么多机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜，你知道吗？你比我的孩子更像我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在你身上倾注了那么多心血，即使此刻，只要你愿意，我依然允许你回到我身边——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当我求你最后一件事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴吧，老板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带着你的“礼物”和这些虚情假意，离我远一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，埃琳娜·乌比卡，从今天开始，不再是在你手下任你摆布的傻助手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐尔迪南·克鲁尼，你被我开除了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g11_monitoringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斐尔迪南主任！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我抓住她，抓住这个暴徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱茵防卫科成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主任，您没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃琳娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要......再用这种......看起来很关心我的眼神......看着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这让我觉得......恶心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你说我不理解你，可你也并没有真正理解我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许......在刚才那一刹那，我是有过犹豫和担心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那并不是我担心你给我捣乱，而是我在担心你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐尔迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是......真的不想看着你走到这一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这句话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......我也想原样送给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......怎么办，防卫科的人越来越多了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐尔迪南还真是做足了准备，塞雷娅再能打，也很难一下子打退这么多人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "还得麻烦你帮忙了，缪尔赛思主任。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我？不行的，我并不会打架啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "光是跑来跑去躲避他们的攻击，我就已经很费劲了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你没听到我呼呼喘气吗，博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你刚才就很巧妙地帮了塞雷娅一把，不是吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "只要你不再故意拖时间就行。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你发现了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "塞雷娅很久没回莱茵总部，但还记得哪里是监控区。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你总是有意无意干扰塞雷娅的视线。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "自从听到我猜测总辖就在这里，你明显不再着急。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......差一点就真的中招了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......你竟然还拉着我？你......你还愿意拉着我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明猜到我可能有其他想法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有什么想法都是你的自由。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我并不在乎你究竟是什么立场。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我请你帮助塞雷娅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这是为了罗德岛和莱茵生命的共同利益。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这是为了哥伦比亚与其他国家的安全考虑。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这也是为了你。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算上这次，你已经救了我两回了，Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当作是报答好了，至少这一回，我会站在你们身边，帮助塞雷娅去她想去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听到我的呼唤了吗，水分子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亲吻眼前的每一位生灵，卷走脚下的所有尘埃吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......精灵动摇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是可怜的生灵......她总是希望自己能从其他人口中得到一些关于明天的允诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁又会甘愿承认自己与自己所属的族群只属于过去呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克丽斯腾没法给她的东西，那位Dr.{@nickname}难道可以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥伦比亚雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，塞雷娅已经突破了封锁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就让她见见自己的老朋友吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还有其他工作要完成......只能下一次再与这位机械师先生交流了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍尔海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——要是他能从这批动力甲手中活下来的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有多久没有回来了？\n一千四百九十七天。\n分别的时候，或许已是敌人。\n再见的时候，又还是朋友吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g10_senioroffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回来了，塞雷娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你好，克丽斯腾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "aliases": [
        "缪尔赛思"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
